55, 255, 255);caret-color: rgb(53, 53, 53);max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;color: black;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          Dark grape, Fruit wine-like, Honey melon with cacao nibs finish\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='color: rgb(53, 53, 53);font-size: 14px;text-align: start;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);caret-color: rgb(53, 53, 53);max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TIUwcbdmZuMTA8I4KGFus9sPh5HcNDVBJibNVbKn5Bg0tqichghRGKAFFh7ibzv7443SNm9abCCR8lw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"width: 578px;height: 773px;\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7TAWWsbN3mr1FLZttGiavtib4yTF4pjQYW9PP6RnwcvH1mibJmJicBoSGVdyDibqR46cJ9NjN0Rq3Cflmg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='color: rgb(53, 53, 53);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 黑体, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;text-align: center;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;color: rgb(178, 178, 178);\">\n          Antioquia在正北方向，豆沙色\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"